      "title": "Crashes in history (2000, 2008, 2020)",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Crashes in history (2000, 2008, 2020)"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/1-krachy-w-historii.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                "**2000** – the dot-com bubble bursts, tech companies lose most of their value",
                "**2008** – a crisis in the US housing market drags the whole world down",
                "**2020** – the pandemic: one of the fastest falls in history and one of the fastest rebounds"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "text": "Crashes happen, but the broad market has historically **come back higher**. That's no guarantee for the future."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": []
      },
      "tasks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Emotions vs plan",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Emotions vs plan"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/2-emocje-vs-plan.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "When the market falls, your brain screams “**run**”, when it rises – “**buy more**”. That's why most people buy high and sell low."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What protects you is **a plan written before the crash**: how much you pay in, into what, and when you rebalance."
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "text": "Make decisions calmly. During the storm, **just follow the plan**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": []
      },
      "tasks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "The cost of missing the best days",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "The cost of missing the best days"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/3-koszt-pominiecia-najlepszych.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The best days on the stock market often come **right after the worst ones** – in the middle of the panic."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Whoever sold in fear and waits “until things calm down” usually **misses the rebound**."
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "text": "Missing just **a few of the best days** over many years can seriously lower the final result."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": []
      },
      "tasks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "What to do during crashes",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "What to do during crashes"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/4-co-robic-podczas-krachu.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                "**Don't sell in a panic** – a loss only becomes real when you sell",
                "**Keep paying in** – you're buying cheaper",
                "**Rebalance** if your proportions have drifted a lot",
                "**Don't check your portfolio** every hour"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "text": "With a 20-year horizon, what happens today **doesn't matter much**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
